Meta.documentation:String.equal
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Tells whether Strings are the same.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first String in the flow binds as the comparee; every String after it is
Meta.documentation:compared against it. Emits true only if all of them are equal.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_comparee — the first String, the one others are compared with
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all — each following String to compare
Meta.documentation:@port out_Boolean_default — true if all compared Strings equal the comparee
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:Hello String:Hello]>>String.equal:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:true
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.equal
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0Afunction%20compare()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22compare%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DcompareProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20compareProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_Boolean_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_String_comparee%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.tempString%20%3D%20input.value%3B%20%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%20%20%20%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20this%3F.out_Boolean_default(%7Bvalue%3Athis.tempString%20%3D%3D%3D%20input.value%7D)%3B%20%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Acompare.Processor%3DcompareProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dcompare%3B]>>NewResource:String.equal
